{"body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><svg class=\"brand-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 98 33\" width=\"103\" height=\"35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g class=\"header-spark\"><path d=\"M13.9822 0L23.9694 4.49428L19.4751 14.4815L9.48789 9.98725L13.9822 0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></g><path d=\"M0 15.4803H10.4866V22.4713H19.4751V15.4803H29.9618V32.9579H0V15.4803Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M34.9551 8.48962H37.6005V23.9311H37.7326L40.7085 21.1206L46.3958 15.8962H49.636L42.56 22.5755L50.4628 32.9579H47.1892L40.543 24.0965L37.6005 26.7748V32.9579H34.9551V8.48962Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M59.8061 12.1268C59.0344 12.1268 58.4943 11.967 58.1858 11.6473C57.8773 11.3277 57.7226 10.9254 57.7226 10.4405V9.91142C57.7226 9.42647 57.8773 9.0242 58.1858 8.70461C58.4943 8.38495 59.0344 8.2251 59.8061 8.2251C60.5774 8.2251 61.1174 8.38495 61.426 8.70461C61.7348 9.0242 61.8891 9.42647 61.8891 9.91142V10.4405C61.8891 10.9254 61.7348 11.3277 61.426 11.6473C61.1174 11.967 60.5774 12.1268 59.8061 12.1268ZM52.333 30.7095H58.4834V18.1447H52.333V15.8962H61.1287V30.7095H66.882V32.958H52.333V30.7095Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M68.1133 30.7095H74.0648V10.7381H68.1133V8.48962H76.7101V30.7095H82.6619V32.9579H68.1133V30.7095Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M84.4424 32.958V15.8963H87.0877V18.6738H87.2198C87.3962 18.255 87.6169 17.8527 87.8811 17.467C88.1457 17.0812 88.4709 16.745 88.8567 16.4584C89.2422 16.1719 89.6999 15.9404 90.2287 15.764C90.7579 15.5877 91.375 15.4995 92.0806 15.4995C93.866 15.4995 95.299 16.0672 96.3791 17.2025C97.459 18.3377 97.9991 19.9413 97.9991 22.0134V32.958H95.3541V22.4763C95.3541 20.9112 95.0122 19.7484 94.3291 18.988C93.6457 18.2274 92.6428 17.8472 91.3202 17.8472C90.791 17.8472 90.273 17.9133 89.766 18.0456C89.2589 18.1778 88.807 18.3762 88.4103 18.6407C88.0136 18.9053 87.6938 19.2469 87.4513 19.6657C87.2089 20.0846 87.0877 20.5695 87.0877 21.1206V32.958H84.4424Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"#local\">Vision</a><a href=\"#hardware\">Hardware</a><a href=\"#workflow\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">Contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-heading\"><span class=\"meta\">Explore Kiln</span><span class=\"meta\">Private AI. Local compute.</span></div><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Vision<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"#workflow\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>About<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"intro-runway\">\n<section class=\"section hero\" id=\"top\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"hero-poster\"><h1 class=\"hero-title\" id=\"hero-title\"><span class=\"hero-keep\">Keep the</span> <span class=\"hero-box\"><span class=\"hero-work\">work</span></span> <span class=\"hero-close\">close.</span></h1><figure class=\"hero-device\"><img src=\"/assets/one-proportions.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Kiln One: a satin aluminium local AI workstation with a blue front grille and tilted-square status light\" decoding=\"async\"><img class=\"hero-macro\" src=\"/assets/one-macro-detail-v2.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div>\n<div class=\"hero-bottom\"><p>Private AI.<br>Under your control.</p><div class=\"action-row\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"intro-caption\"><button class=\"intro-skip\" aria-label=\"Skip the close-up and explore Kiln\">Scroll to explore <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></button></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section local\" id=\"local\" aria-labelledby=\"local-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">01 / A new way to operate</span><span class=\"meta\">AI-native from the start.</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"local-title\">An OS built<br>around intent.</h2><p>Meet KilnOS. An AI-native operating system being built around the agent. Files, applications and workflows, connected around what you want to do.</p></div>\n<div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / Files</span><h3>Everything<br>in context.</h3><p>Find files by what they mean. Keep references, versions and decisions connected to the work.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / Applications</span><h3>Tools working<br>together.</h3><p>Let your agent coordinate connected applications, carrying context and permissions from one tool to the next.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / Workflows</span><h3>From intent<br>to action.</h3><p>Describe the outcome. Review the plan. Approve key actions as your agent moves the work forward.</p></article></div>\n<p class=\"fine\">KilnOS / In development. Capabilities and integrations will be validated in pilots.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section hardware\" id=\"hardware\" data-product=\"one\" aria-labelledby=\"hardware-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">02 / The hardware</span><span class=\"meta\">A physical home for your AI.</span></div>\n<div class=\"hardware-heading\"><h2 id=\"hardware-title\">Choose your<br>capacity.</h2><div class=\"product-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose Kiln hardware\"><button id=\"tab-one\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"product-one\" data-product=\"one\">Kiln One</button><button id=\"tab-atelier\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"product-atelier\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-product=\"atelier\">Atelier</button><button id=\"tab-rack\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"product-rack\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-product=\"rack\">Atelier Rack</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"product-carousel\" aria-label=\"Kiln hardware\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"product-slide\" id=\"product-one\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-one\" data-product-slide=\"one\"><div class=\"product-stage\"><div class=\"product-copy\"><p class=\"meta\">Kiln One</p><p class=\"product-tagline\">Your studio.<br>Your compute.</p></div><figure class=\"product-figure\"><img src=\"/assets/one-interior-yellow.webp\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Kiln One with a yellow grille and exposed internal components\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></figure><h3 class=\"product-name\">One.</h3></div><div class=\"product-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">£17,000</p><span class=\"product-price-note\">Target hardware price</span></div><p class=\"product-description\">Your own AI models. Your private projects. Shared from one compact workstation.</p><div class=\"product-actions\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one\">Explore Kiln One <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"text-link compare-open\">Compare configurations <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"product-slide\" id=\"product-atelier\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-atelier\" data-product-slide=\"atelier\"><div class=\"product-stage\"><div class=\"product-copy\"><p class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier</p><p class=\"product-tagline\">More capacity.<br>Same control.</p></div><figure class=\"product-figure\"><img src=\"/assets/atelier-interior-red.webp\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier with a red grille and exposed internal components\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></figure><h3 class=\"product-name\">Atelier.</h3></div><div class=\"product-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">Let’s talk</p><span class=\"product-price-note\">Pricing to be confirmed</span></div><p class=\"product-description\">Rack-ready compute for demanding creative work. More models, more capacity, in your studio.</p><div class=\"product-actions\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/atelier\">Explore Kiln Atelier <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"text-link compare-open\">Compare configurations <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"product-slide\" id=\"product-rack\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-rack\" data-product-slide=\"rack\"><div class=\"product-stage\"><div class=\"product-copy\"><p class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier Rack</p><p class=\"product-tagline\">Room for<br>what comes next.</p></div><figure class=\"product-figure\"><img src=\"/assets/atelier-rack-frame-blue.webp\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Four Kiln Ateliers in a wheeled aluminium rack\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></figure><h3 class=\"product-name\">Atelier Rack.</h3></div><div class=\"product-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">Let’s talk</p><span class=\"product-price-note\">Configuration and pricing on request</span></div><p class=\"product-description\">Four Ateliers. One modular rack. Grow your studio’s private compute as the work grows.</p><div class=\"product-actions\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier Rack\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/rack\">Explore Kiln Atelier Rack <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"text-link compare-open\">Compare configurations <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"carousel-controls\"><span class=\"meta carousel-hint\">Swipe to explore</span><span class=\"carousel-count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">01 / 03</span><button class=\"carousel-prev\" aria-label=\"Previous hardware\" disabled>←</button><button class=\"carousel-next\" aria-label=\"Next hardware\">→</button></div>\n<p class=\"fine\">Concept renders. Final configuration, software, support, taxes and delivery terms to be confirmed.</p>\n</section>\n<figure class=\"studio-photo\" id=\"studio\"><img src=\"/assets/studio-rack-1536.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/studio-rack-768.webp 768w,assets/studio-rack-1536.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier rack in a creative studio with work tables, Mac displays and colourful artwork\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span>A new way to work. A private place to make it happen.</span><span>Kiln Atelier Rack / Studio concept render</span></figcaption></figure>\n<section class=\"section workflow\" id=\"workflow\" aria-labelledby=\"workflow-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">03 / Inside KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">An operating system around you.</span></div>\n<div class=\"workflow-layout\"><div class=\"workflow-copy\"><h2 id=\"workflow-title\">Intent becomes<br><span class=\"word-frame\">action.</span></h2><p>Tell KilnOS what you want to achieve. Your agent brings together the context, tools and next steps—with you in control.</p></div><div><div class=\"workspace\"><div class=\"workspace-top\"><span class=\"meta\">KilnOS / Launch campaign</span><span class=\"private-indicator\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Your approval</span></div><div class=\"work-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Explore the KilnOS vision\"><button id=\"work-files\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"work-panel\" data-workflow=\"files\">01 Files</button><button id=\"work-apps\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"work-panel\" data-workflow=\"apps\" tabindex=\"-1\">02 Apps</button><button id=\"work-flows\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"work-panel\" data-workflow=\"flows\" tabindex=\"-1\">03 Workflows</button></div><div class=\"work-panel\" id=\"work-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"work-files\"><h3 id=\"work-quote\">“Find the latest.<br>Show what changed.”</h3><p id=\"work-note\">Bring the approved brief, references and feedback into one project context.</p></div><div class=\"workspace-files\" id=\"workspace-files\"><span>Brief v3.pdf</span><span>Approved references</span><span>Client feedback</span></div></div><p class=\"workspace-caption\">KilnOS interaction concept / In development</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"workflow-notes\"><article><h3>One conversation.</h3><p>Move between finding, making and organising without resetting the brief.</p></article><article><h3>Context that carries.</h3><p>Keep files, choices and feedback connected as the work changes.</p></article><article><h3>You set the boundaries.</h3><p>Decide what your agent can access and which actions need your approval.</p></article></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section privacy\" id=\"privacy\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">04 / The boundary matters</span><span class=\"meta\">Local by design.</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"privacy-title\" id=\"privacy-title\"><span class=\"privacy-first\">What stays</span> <span class=\"privacy-inside\">inside.</span> <span class=\"privacy-tail\">The work that matters.</span></h2>\n<div class=\"privacy-grid\"><article><h3>Client work.</h3><p>Briefs and unreleased ideas. Kept close.</p></article><article><h3>Studio knowledge.</h3><p>Contracts and accounts. Under your control.</p></article><article><h3>Creative iterations.</h3><p>Prompts and drafts. Designed to stay local.</p></article></div>\n<p class=\"fine\">In development. Cloud tools require approval. Privacy protections to be validated in pilots.</p>\n</section>\n<figure class=\"hardware-interlude\" aria-labelledby=\"hardware-interlude-caption\">\n<img src=\"/assets/atelier-dark-v1.webp\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier with a black powder-coated grille, softly lit aluminium shell and illuminated tilted-square status light against a black background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<figcaption id=\"hardware-interlude-caption\"><p>A place for<br>your ideas.</p><span class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier / Black concept</span></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"questions\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">05 / A closer look</span><span class=\"meta\">A few practical answers.</span></div>\n<div class=\"faq-layout\"><div><h2 id=\"faq-title\">Clear on<br>the details.</h2><p class=\"fine\">Early hardware. A deliberate direction.<br>No shipping date announced.</p></div><div>\n<details><summary>What makes KilnOS different?</summary><p>Our vision is an operating system organised around your intent. An AI agent connects files, applications and workflows, carrying context between tasks and asking for approval where it matters. KilnOS is in development; capabilities, integrations and the path to deployment will be validated in pilots.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Does every task stay local?</summary><p>Local workflows are designed to keep models, prompts, source files and generated drafts on Kiln and authorised team devices. Optional external tools require project approval. Company sign-in and software updates may still need internet access.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can we use our own models?</summary><p>The plan is a studio-managed model collection. Choices depend on model licensing, compatibility and available memory. The first collection is being qualified for creative directions, image storyboards and revision.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What does £17,000 include?</summary><p>£17,000 is Kiln One’s target hardware price, not a quote. Final configuration, software, support, taxes and delivery terms are still to be confirmed. Atelier and rack pricing will depend on configuration.</p></details>\n<details><summary>When can I order Kiln?</summary><p>Register interest for product news and launch details. Orders are not open yet, and no payment or commitment is required.</p></details><details><summary>How do we discuss a pilot or investment?</summary><p>Use Contact and choose Studio pilot or Investment enquiry. Pilots are being developed through direct conversations with studios; joining the interest list is not an application for a pilot.</p></details>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section pilot\" id=\"interest\" aria-labelledby=\"interest-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">06 / Stay close to Kiln</span><span class=\"meta\">Private compute / In development</span></div><h2 class=\"pilot-title\" id=\"interest-title\">Be first<span>to know.</span></h2><div class=\"pilot-bottom\"><p class=\"lead\">Hardware. KilnOS. Launch news.<br>Straight to your inbox.</p><div><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"fine\">No payment or commitment. <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy details</a></p></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">About Kiln</a><a href=\"#hardware\">The hardware</a><a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a><a href=\"#privacy\">Our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">Contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"#top\">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">Stay close to Kiln</span><h2 id=\"register-title\">Be first<br>to know.</h2><p>Product news, launch details and a closer look at private, local compute.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">Email address</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">Which Kiln interests you? <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Kiln Atelier</option><option>Kiln Atelier Rack</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Email me Kiln product and launch updates. I can unsubscribe at any time.</span></label><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">Your details go to the Kiln team through Formspree. <a href=\"/privacy\">How we use your information</a></p><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary\" type=\"submit\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>You’re on the list.</h3><p>Your interest has been registered. We’ll be in touch as Kiln takes shape.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></dialog>\n\n<dialog id=\"enquiry-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close contact\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">Contact Kiln</span><h2 id=\"enquiry-title\">Let’s talk.</h2><p>A question, a partnership or a conversation about what comes next.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/book/\">Book a conversation <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"contact\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"work-email\">Email address</label><input id=\"work-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"studio-name\">Organisation <span>(optional)</span></label><input id=\"studio-name\" name=\"organisation\" maxlength=\"160\" autocomplete=\"organization\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"enquiry-interest\">What would you like to discuss?</label><select id=\"enquiry-interest\" name=\"reason\"><option>General question</option><option>Studio pilot</option><option>Investment enquiry</option><option>Partnership</option><option>Privacy or unsubscribe request</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"workflow-message\">Your message</label><textarea id=\"workflow-message\" name=\"message\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"Tell us a little more.\" required></textarea></div><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">We’ll use your details to respond to this enquiry. This doesn’t add you to marketing updates. <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy details</a></p><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary\" type=\"submit\">Send enquiry <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>We’ve got your message.</h3><p>Your enquiry has been sent to the Kiln team.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"compare-dialog\" class=\"compare-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close comparison\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">Hardware / Compare</span><h2 id=\"compare-title\">Find your fit.</h2><p>Proposed configurations. In development.</p><div class=\"compare-grid\"><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln One</h3><strong>£17,000</strong><p class=\"fine\">Target hardware price</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 5000 / 72 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable up to 2</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>128 GB / 4 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></dl></article><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln Atelier</h3><strong>Let’s talk</strong><p class=\"fine\">Configuration and pricing to be confirmed</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 Max-Q / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>2 GPUs, expandable up to 4</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>512 GB ECC / 8 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>520 × 220 × 600 mm</dd></dl></article></div><p class=\"fine\">Atelier Rack combines four Ateliers in a modular enclosure. All figures are engineering targets, subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; multiple cards do not automatically form one memory pool. Renders show expanded component concepts.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to the hardware <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></dialog>\n", "title": "Kiln — Keep the work close.", "description": "Private AI hardware and KilnOS: an AI-native operating system in development, built around the agent. Keep the work close.", "path": "/"}